# Prisma Patterns

- Prisma schema lives at `prisma/schema.prisma`.
- Prisma migrations live under `prisma/migrations`.
- Backend code must access the database through `PrismaService`.
- Do not use raw SQL for app behavior unless there is no Prisma equivalent and the reason is documented.
- Every schema change needs a migration and generated client update.
- Scenario runs are append-only audit records; do not delete them in normal app flows.
